{"page":222,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.5 • 연결지향형 트랜스포트 TCP","words":[{"text":"3.5","x":964,"y":146,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1038,"y":150,"width":12,"height":14},{"text":"연결지향형","x":1084,"y":145,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1224,"y":147,"width":129,"height":28},{"text":"TCP","x":1377,"y":148,"width":61,"height":27}]},{"text":"버는 두 번째 특별한 TCP 세그먼트로 응답한다. 마지막으로 클라이언트가 세 번째 특","words":[{"text":"버는","x":183,"y":268,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":260,"y":269,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"번째","x":310,"y":268,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"특별한","x":389,"y":267,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":499,"y":273,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"세그먼트로","x":581,"y":269,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"응답한다.","x":756,"y":270,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"마지막으로","x":909,"y":272,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트가","x":1089,"y":273,"width":201,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":1302,"y":273,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":1351,"y":274,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"특","x":1428,"y":275,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"별한 세그먼트로 다시 응답한다. 처음 2개 의 세그먼트에는 “페이로드”, 즉 애플리케이","words":[{"text":"별한","x":184,"y":328,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트로","x":261,"y":327,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"다시","x":442,"y":328,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"응답한다.","x":518,"y":328,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"처음","x":673,"y":329,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"2개","x":747,"y":330,"width":48,"height":37},{"text":"의","x":812,"y":331,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트에는","x":856,"y":331,"width":198,"height":37},{"text":"“페이로드”,","x":1066,"y":330,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"즉","x":1250,"y":334,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"애플리케이","x":1296,"y":332,"width":162,"height":38}]},{"text":"션 계층 데이터가 없다. 세 번째 세그먼트는 페이로드를 포함할 수 있다. 두 호스트 사","words":[{"text":"션","x":183,"y":389,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":229,"y":388,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"데이터가","x":310,"y":389,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"없다.","x":458,"y":389,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"세","x":543,"y":389,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":590,"y":389,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트는","x":666,"y":390,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"페이로드를","x":843,"y":391,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"포함할","x":1021,"y":391,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1134,"y":392,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1183,"y":392,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1271,"y":394,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":1318,"y":394,"width":98,"height":31},{"text":"사","x":1430,"y":393,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"이에 3개의 세그먼트가 보내지므로, 이 연결 설정 절자는 흔히 게 방햼 랜드세이크","words":[{"text":"이에","x":183,"y":448,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"3개의","x":264,"y":449,"width":84,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트가","x":368,"y":448,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"보내지므로,","x":549,"y":450,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":739,"y":451,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"연결","x":788,"y":450,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"설정","x":869,"y":451,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"절자는","x":952,"y":451,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"흔히","x":1066,"y":451,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"게","x":1149,"y":451,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"방햼","x":1207,"y":452,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"랜드세이크","x":1298,"y":453,"width":165,"height":37}]},{"text":"(three-way handshake)라 부른다.","words":[{"text":"(three-way","x":181,"y":514,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"handshake)라","x":368,"y":510,"width":220,"height":38},{"text":"부른다.","x":600,"y":511,"width":104,"height":37}]},{"text":"일단 TCP 연결이 설정되면, 두 애플리케이션 프로세스는 서로 데이터를 보낼 수","words":[{"text":"일단","x":248,"y":569,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":327,"y":575,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"연결이","x":416,"y":570,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"설정되면,","x":529,"y":570,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":681,"y":573,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":729,"y":571,"width":194,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":939,"y":570,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"서로","x":1123,"y":572,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":1206,"y":573,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"보낼","x":1353,"y":574,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1432,"y":574,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"있다. 클라이언트 프로세스에서 서버 프로세스로의 데이터 송신을 고려해 보자. 클라","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":183,"y":629,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트","x":272,"y":631,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스에서","x":456,"y":631,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":669,"y":632,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스로의","x":748,"y":632,"width":194,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":963,"y":631,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"송신을","x":1077,"y":632,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"고려해","x":1195,"y":634,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"보자.","x":1310,"y":634,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"클라","x":1400,"y":634,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"이언트 프로세스는 2.7절에 설명된 소켓(프로세스의 관문)을 통해서 데이터의 스트림","words":[{"text":"이언트","x":182,"y":690,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스는","x":295,"y":692,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"2.7절에","x":478,"y":691,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"설명된","x":607,"y":692,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"소켓(프로세스의","x":717,"y":692,"width":240,"height":39},{"text":"관문)을","x":975,"y":692,"width":114,"height":38},{"text":"통해서","x":1103,"y":693,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"데이터의","x":1222,"y":694,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"스트림","x":1368,"y":695,"width":95,"height":35}]},{"text":"을 전달한다. 데이터가 관문을 통해 전달되면, 이제 데이터는 클라이언트에서 동작하","words":[{"text":"을","x":179,"y":751,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"전달한다.","x":230,"y":751,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"데이터가","x":391,"y":752,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"관문을","x":536,"y":752,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"통해","x":649,"y":753,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"전달되면,","x":731,"y":753,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"이제","x":887,"y":753,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"데이터는","x":969,"y":753,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트에서","x":1118,"y":754,"width":231,"height":38},{"text":"동작하","x":1368,"y":755,"width":100,"height":37}]},{"text":"고 있는 TCP에 맡기진다. 그림 3.28에 보이듯이 TCP는 초기 세 방향 핸드세이그 동","words":[{"text":"고","x":181,"y":816,"width":31,"height":28},{"text":"있는","x":230,"y":812,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"TCP에","x":308,"y":814,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"맡기진다.","x":430,"y":813,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":585,"y":814,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"3.28에","x":665,"y":814,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"보이듯이","x":777,"y":813,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"TCP는","x":922,"y":816,"width":106,"height":34},{"text":"초기","x":1042,"y":815,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"세","x":1125,"y":815,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"방향","x":1174,"y":816,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"핸드세이그","x":1256,"y":816,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"동","x":1435,"y":817,"width":33,"height":36}]},{"text":"안 준비된 버퍼의 하나인 연결의 송신 버퍼(send buffer)로 데이터를 보낸다. 때때로","words":[{"text":"안","x":181,"y":873,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"준비된","x":227,"y":873,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼의","x":347,"y":875,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"하나인","x":461,"y":875,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"연결의","x":577,"y":875,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":686,"y":874,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼(send","x":768,"y":874,"width":149,"height":39},{"text":"buffer)로","x":931,"y":878,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"데이터를","x":1096,"y":875,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"보낸다.","x":1246,"y":876,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"때때로","x":1372,"y":876,"width":97,"height":37}]},{"text":"TCP는 송신 버퍼에서 데이터 묶음을 “만들어서” 네트워크로 보낸다. TCP 명세서","words":[{"text":"TCP는","x":179,"y":935,"width":107,"height":35},{"text":"송신","x":303,"y":935,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼에서","x":392,"y":935,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"데이터","x":545,"y":935,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"묶음을","x":661,"y":935,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"“만들어서”","x":778,"y":935,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크로","x":961,"y":935,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"보낸다.","x":1149,"y":936,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1278,"y":941,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"명세서","x":1370,"y":937,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"[RFC 7931에서 TCP는 “자신이 편한 대로 세그먼트의 데이터를 전송기야 한다고 기","words":[{"text":"[RFC","x":181,"y":999,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"7931에서","x":278,"y":997,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"TCP는","x":430,"y":998,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"“자신이","x":548,"y":996,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"편한","x":675,"y":996,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"대로","x":754,"y":996,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":832,"y":995,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1013,"y":995,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"전송기야","x":1163,"y":997,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"한다고","x":1323,"y":998,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"기","x":1439,"y":998,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"술하고 있으며, TCP가 언제 버퍼된 데이터를 전송해야 하는지 기술하고 있지 않다. 세","words":[{"text":"술하고","x":180,"y":1056,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"있으며,","x":294,"y":1057,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"TCP가","x":415,"y":1057,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"언제","x":534,"y":1057,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼된","x":612,"y":1057,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":721,"y":1057,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"전송해야","x":865,"y":1056,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"하는지","x":1010,"y":1056,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"기술하고","x":1125,"y":1057,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"있지","x":1272,"y":1058,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"않다.","x":1349,"y":1059,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":1437,"y":1058,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"그먼트의 크기는 최대 세그먼트 크기(maximum segment size, MSS)로 제한된다.","words":[{"text":"그먼트의","x":181,"y":1117,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"크기는","x":333,"y":1119,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"최대","x":453,"y":1119,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트","x":536,"y":1118,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"크기(maximum","x":686,"y":1118,"width":245,"height":39},{"text":"segment","x":946,"y":1124,"width":137,"height":34},{"text":"size,","x